<title>HUNGARY: CESI INDEX JUMPS TO END AT 1,449.82 PTS.</title>
<headline>CESI INDEX JUMPS TO END AT 1,449.82 PTS.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index rose 30.40 points or 2.14 percent to 1,449.82 on Monday, the Budapest Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index reflects trends of 72 Hungrian, Polish, Czech, Slovak and Slovenian shares.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
